PHASE 4 — Royal Road (HTML Scraping):
- RoyalRoadSource extends BaseJsoupSource
- Selectors: .fiction-list-item, .fic-header, .chapter-content, table#chapters
- Supports Popular, Latest, New browse modes + search
- Chapter list + content extraction
- Registered in SourceModule (@IntoSet) and PluginRegistry

PHASE 5 — Inkitt (Reverse-Engineered API):
- InkittApiService with Retrofit: auth, story, chapters, search, popular, latest
- InkittModels: Story, Author, Chapter, ChapterContent, SearchResponse
- InkittAuthInterceptor for Bearer token injection
- InkittRepository implements NovelSource with auth, browse, search, detail
- InkittNetworkModule for Hilt DI
- Registered in PluginRegistry

PHASE 6 — Supabase Backend:
- SupabaseClientProvider: lazy init gated by feature flag + credentials
- SupabaseRepository: auth (Google OAuth), reading progress sync,
  platform credentials storage, story metadata cache
- SupabaseModule for Hilt DI
- Added supabase-kt dependencies (postgrest, auth, realtime)

Refs: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §6, §7, §14
